    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MURPHY MULLAN are delighted to present this charming three bedroomed property for sale.  \r\n\r\nNo 45 has a number of bonus features including its excellent location, rear lane access and sunny south private front facing garden and rating making this one for the short list!\r\n\r\nThe location is simply superb with the Phoenix Park on its door step providing both country and city living in the heart of Dublin with stunning walks and scenery.  There are excellent local schools and a host of shops and necessary amenities. With an excellent public transport system to and from Dublin City Centre with both the N3 and M50 close by providing easy access to most route ways.  Broombridge green luas line is only as few minutes’ walk making many locations easily accessible\r\n\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway:\tWooden Floorboards\r\nLiving Room:\tWooden Floorboards / Open fire with tile and wood surround / Cooper roofed bay window\r\nDining Room:\tWooden Floorboards / Electric Feature Fireplace\r\nKitchen: An array of Maple Kitchen presses top and bottom / Stones concrete tiling floor\r\nUPSTAIRS:\t\t\r\nLanding:\tLaminate Flooring\r\nAttic: (Potential for conversion) Floored with Velux window and Stirra Staircase\r\nBedroom 1: Front double / Carpeted with stand-alone wardrobe\r\nBedroom 2: Back double\t/ Built in wardrobes / Carpeted\r\nBedroom 3: Large single\t/ Carpeted with stand-alone wardrobe\r\nMain bathroom: Fully tiled bathroom. Bath with overhead Triton shower"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Highly Sought After, Mature Residential Area!\r\nPhoenix Park on your doorstep!\r\nBroombridge Luas Green Line 10 min drive\r\nStoneybatter/Smithfield Red Luas Line 10/15 min drive\r\nDublin City Centre approx 15mins by bus\r\nHost of excellent local Primary and Secondary schools \r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nNew Ideal Logic gas boiler\r\nAdjacent McKee Barracks\r\nRear Vehicular Access by Lane\r\nPotential for Attic Conversion\r\nPotential for extension to side of property subject to PP"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E"
      }
    ],
